pageCss: score
permalink: /score/
# ── INDEXED ON PURPOSE. Unlike /scorecard/, /start/ and /pre-call/, this page is
#    meant to be found by strangers — that is the whole reason it exists. It asks
#    nothing before it gives an answer, so there is nothing here to hide from search.
#
# ── GHL form id for "Free Website Scorecard - Front Desk Score": a duplicate of
#    the /scorecard/ form (J9WkThXTnIN59SBHNPxX). Attribution comes from the form
#    IDENTITY — submissions are per-form, so a lead from the quiz is
#    distinguishable from one on /roi/ or /scorecard/ with no hidden field.
#    Three fields (Full Name / Website / Email), no phone field, so this page
#    carries no A2P surface.
#    Verified 2026-08-08 against the public widget config: actionType 2
#    (thank-you message), redirectUrl empty — it did NOT inherit a redirect.
